# Testing

Testing follows the architecture.

## Unit tests
Services, managers, business logic, complex utilities.

## Integration tests
Repository + real database, external integrations, Kafka/message processing, security boundaries.

## API tests
HTTP status, request validation, response structure, authorization, error handling.

## Principles
- Do not mock everything. Use real infrastructure in integration tests where it gives meaningful confidence.
- Verify behavior, not implementation details.
- Cover failure paths and idempotency, not only the happy path.
